{"id": "70145", "title": "人生赢家进化论", "author": "梦溪石", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70145/70145s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70145.htm", "intro": "父母离异，感情淡薄，失业失恋，毫无存款。\r\n    生活处处碰壁，一惨再惨，难道没有好家世就意味着永无出头之日？\r\n    尤佳本来也这么觉得，所以她准备去自杀了。\r\n    但事实证明，人生总有意外出现。\r\n    失败落魄的丑女为什么就不能拥有华丽人生呢？\r\n    人生不能重来，不是非得穿越或重生才能凤凰涅盘。\r\n    终有一天，挫货也可以变成人生赢家。\r\n    阅读指南：\r\n    1、女主：从挫货到白富美。男主：高富萌。是以又名：挫货大战高富萌。\r\n    2、轻松文风，信手而写，博君一笑。\r\n    3、更新时间一般是晚上8点，若有延迟或变更会提前留言通知，除此时间以外的更新都是捉虫。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70145", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第 1 章", "file": "10854890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "10854891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "10854892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "10854893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "10854894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "10854895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "10854896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "10854897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "10854898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "10854899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "10854900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "10854901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "10854902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "10854903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "10854904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "10854905.html", "available": true}, {"title": "17-21", "file": "10855842.html", "available": true}, {"title": "22-25", "file": "10855843.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-29", "file": "10855844.html", "available": true}, {"title": "30-35", "file": "10855845.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10855846.html", "available": tr